{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChPiNo8A477aFPHwS248b","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Kubernetes executor is in `internal/executor/kube`, with the shared types it needs added to `internal/executor`. `go vet` and `go test -race` on `./internal/executor/...` pass, including `-count=5` on the kube package. gofmt is clean on the files I changed. The kube tests use only the fake API and an httptest result server, so none of this has run against a real cluster.\n\nThe change comes to about 2,100 lines including tests, under the 3,000 limit. The report is at `.ard/340/worker-engineer.md`.\n\nDeviations from the plan, and the approximations in it:\n- **`Sweep` and the repo:** `Sweep(ctx, keep)` takes the repo from a new `Options.Repo`, because the plan gave it no repo argument.\n- **Network label:** `NetworkAdvisory` and `NetworkNone` both map to `false`, and `NetworkOn` maps to `true`.\n- **`.git` after the swap:** the result has no `.git`, so the original worktree's `.git` link is moved into it. That keeps close-out's git calls working. `tarball.Unpack` already refuses a `.git` entry.\n- **Held job whose pod vanished:** `Status` reports Running until the watcher writes its marker, so the final Gone carries the real end reason. Otherwise it could briefly report Gone with `EndNoResult`. `mapStatus` itself follows the plan's table.\n- **Unschedulable pods:** the API types carry no scheduling condition, so I approximated \"unschedulable\" as Pending with `pre` still waiting for 5 minutes.\n- **Secret volumes:** pre and post get separate Secret volumes, so only pre mounts the token and only post mounts the result key.\n- **Small additions outside the new package:** `FSGroupChangePolicy` in the API types, and `SetInitContainer` and `Mutate` in the fake.\n\n`golangci-lint` reports errcheck findings in the repo that I did not touch; the repo's own `make lint` (vet and gofmt) is clean for these files."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1234,"cache_read_input_tokens":116641,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1234},"output_tokens":679,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"caaac10a-be20-4f28-971a-a15b2700a532","uuid":"d12f00fa-838a-4165-b46c-6857685e0fb9","timestamp":"2026-11-25T13:20:04.944Z","request_id":"req_011ChPiNnmarvmodeaxiCYXH"}
